msgstr "修复失败：%s"

msgid "Repair replaces missing or damaged Honk system files and does not overwrite user configuration."
msgstr "修复会补齐或替换缺失、损坏的 Honk 系统文件，不会覆盖用户配置。"

msgid "Repair system files"
msgstr "修复系统文件"

