msgstr "启动"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Stop Honk before restoring. Restoring replaces Honk user data. Continue?"
msgstr "恢复前请先停止 Honk 服务。恢复操作会替换 Honk 用户数据，是否继续？"

msgid "System check"
msgstr "系统检查"

msgid "System check failed: %s"
msgstr "系统检查失败：%s"

msgid "System check passed."
msgstr "系统检查通过。"

msgid "The backend did not confirm the check."
msgstr "后端未确认检查结果。"

msgid "The backend did not confirm the operation."
msgstr "后端未确认操作结果。"

msgid "The backend returned an unexpected backup path."
msgstr "后端返回了意外的备份文件路径。"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "用户名"

msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

msgid "Working…"
msgstr "正在处理……"

msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

msgid "Configuration import is unavailable in this core build."
msgstr "此版本核心程序尚未提供配置导入功能。"

msgid "The offline preview and transactional apply interface is not installed yet. No subscription, node, DNS, or proxy setting was changed."
msgstr "离线预览与事务式应用接口尚未安装。本页面没有修改订阅、节点、DNS 或代理设置。"

msgid "Logs"
msgstr "日志"

msgid "Honk log streaming is unavailable in this core build."
msgstr "此版本核心程序尚未提供 Honk 日志读取功能。"

msgid "This page will only read Honk-specific, size-limited logs after the core log interface is installed."
msgstr "核心日志接口安装后，本页面只会读取 Honk 专属且有大小限制的日志。"

msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "服务设置"

msgid "Save service settings"
msgstr "保存服务设置"

msgid "Service settings saved."
msgstr "服务设置已保存。"

msgid "Doona opens its own sign-in page."
msgstr "Doona 会打开独立的登录页面。"

msgid "Doona is not ready yet. Check the service status."
msgstr "Doona 尚未就绪，请检查服务状态。"

msgid "Honk is stopped. Start it to open Doona."
msgstr "Honk 已停止，请先启动服务再打开 Doona。"

msgid "Settings could not be applied."
msgstr "设置应用失败。"

msgid "Add subscription"
msgstr "添加订阅"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

msgid "Subscription URL"
msgstr "订阅地址"

msgid "Preview subscription"
msgstr "预览订阅"

msgid "Import share links"
msgstr "导入分享链接"

msgid "Preview share links"
msgstr "预览分享链接"

msgid "Import dae business configuration"
msgstr "导入 dae 业务配置"

msgid "Only nodes, subscriptions, groups, routing, and DNS sections can be previewed for import. Global settings and external includes are not imported."
msgstr "预览导入仅处理节点、订阅、策略组、路由和 DNS 部分。全局设置与外部 include 不会导入。"

msgid "Checking import support…"
msgstr "正在检查核心程序的导入能力……"

msgid "Checking file and calculating SHA-256…"
msgstr "正在检查文件并计算 SHA-256……"

msgid "Uploading the selected dae file…"
msgstr "正在上传选中的 dae 文件……"

msgid "Browser SHA-256 is unavailable. Open LuCI over HTTPS to preview a dae file."
msgstr "浏览器无法计算 SHA-256，请通过 HTTPS 打开 LuCI 后再预览 dae 文件。"

msgid "File upload failed."
msgstr "文件上传失败。"

msgid "Preview failed."
msgstr "预览失败。"

msgid "Preview is ready. No configuration has been applied."
msgstr "预览已就绪，尚未应用任何配置。"

msgid "Preparing preview…"
msgstr "正在准备预览……"

msgid "Choose a dae file first."
msgstr "请先选择 dae 文件。"

msgid "The dae file exceeds the 2 MiB limit."
msgstr "dae 文件超过 2 MiB 限制。"

msgid "Share links exceed the 16 KiB per request limit. Submit them in smaller batches."
msgstr "分享链接超过每次 16 KiB 的限制，请拆分成多批提交。"

msgid "One link per line. A single request is limited to 16 KiB; larger lists can be submitted in batches. Conflicts are reported for review."
msgstr "每行填写一个链接。单次请求限制为 16 KiB，较大的列表可分批提交；冲突会列出供检查。"

msgid "One file up to 2 MiB. The browser calculates SHA-256 before upload; the core verifies the uploaded file again."
msgstr "单个文件最大 2 MiB。浏览器上传前会计算 SHA-256，核心程序还会再次校验文件。"

msgid "Only nodes, subscriptions, groups, routing, and DNS sections can be previewed. Global settings and external includes are excluded or rejected."
msgstr "预览仅处理节点、订阅、策略组、路由和 DNS 部分。全局设置会排除，外部 include 会拒绝。"

msgid "Imports append subscriptions and nodes by default. Dae import replaces only the listed business sections after preview."
msgstr "订阅和节点默认追加。dae 导入经过预览后，只替换列出的业务配置部分。"

msgid "Import does not start Honk or change DNS settings. After import, assign items to groups and review Doona update behavior."
msgstr "导入不会启动 Honk 或更改 DNS 设置。导入后请分配策略组，并检查 Doona 的更新行为。"

msgid "Saving subscriptions and share links does not start Honk or change routing, DNS, or the enabled state. Dae import replaces business routing and DNS only as shown in the preview; it does not overwrite global or managed system settings."
msgstr "保存订阅和分享链接不会启动 Honk，也不会更改路由、DNS 或启用状态。dae 导入只按预览替换业务路由和 DNS，不会覆盖全局设置或受管理的系统设置。"

msgid "The preview is available when supported by the installed core. Apply remains disabled until a verified transactional apply is available."
msgstr "当前核心程序支持时可使用预览。经过验证的事务式应用功能就绪前，应用操作保持禁用。"

msgid "This core supports preview and apply."
msgstr "此核心程序支持预览和应用。"

msgid "This core supports preview; transactional apply is not installed yet."
msgstr "此核心程序支持预览，但尚未安装事务式应用功能。"

msgid "Import is unavailable in this installed core. Existing service controls remain available."
msgstr "当前安装的核心程序不支持配置导入，现有服务控制仍可使用。"

msgid "Preview summary"
msgstr "预览摘要"

msgid "Candidate: %d nodes, %d subscriptions, %d files changed."
msgstr "候选配置：%d 个节点、%d 个订阅、%d 个文件有更改。"

msgid "Imported sections: %s"
msgstr "导入部分：%s"

msgid "Excluded sections: %s"
msgstr "排除部分：%s"

msgid "Existing sections replaced: %s"
msgstr "替换的现有配置：%s"

msgid "Parser and configuration checks passed. Runtime validation: %s."
msgstr "解析和配置检查已通过。运行时校验：%s。"

msgid "Runtime validation was skipped because candidate listeners and background network tasks are not isolated."
msgstr "候选配置的监听器和后台网络任务尚未隔离，因此跳过了运行时校验。"

msgid "Apply this preview"
msgstr "应用此预览"

msgid "Apply the reviewed preview? Any running Honk service will be stopped during the change and its previous running state will be restored afterward."
msgstr "确认应用已审核的预览吗？更改期间会停止正在运行的 Honk 服务，完成后恢复之前的运行状态。"

msgid "Starting configuration apply…"
msgstr "正在启动配置应用……"

msgid "Configuration applied. Review group assignment and update subscriptions in Doona."
msgstr "配置已应用。请在 Doona 中检查策略组分配并更新订阅。"

msgid "Configuration apply failed."
msgstr "配置应用失败。"

msgid "Waiting for the operation to start…"
msgstr "正在等待操作开始……"

msgid "Preparing configuration apply…"
msgstr "正在准备应用配置……"

msgid "Stopping Honk safely…"
msgstr "正在安全停止 Honk……"

msgid "Applying the reviewed configuration…"
msgstr "正在应用已审核的配置……"

msgid "Checking the updated configuration…"
msgstr "正在检查更新后的配置……"

msgid "Restoring the previous service state…"
msgstr "正在恢复之前的服务状态……"

msgid "Restoring the previous configuration…"
msgstr "正在恢复之前的配置……"

msgid "Finishing the transaction…"
msgstr "正在完成事务……"

msgid "Recovery is required before another operation."
msgstr "需要先完成恢复，才能执行其他操作。"

msgid "Applying configuration…"
msgstr "正在应用配置……"

msgid "passed"
msgstr "已通过"

msgid "not run"
msgstr "未运行"

msgid "Apply is disabled until this core reports transactional import support."
msgstr "核心程序报告支持事务式导入前，应用操作保持禁用。"

msgid "Save any browser draft in Doona before applying configuration changes."
msgstr "应用配置更改前，请先在 Doona 保存浏览器中的草稿。"

msgid "Imported subscriptions and nodes are not assigned to groups automatically. Review group assignment and Doona update behavior after import."
msgstr "导入的订阅和节点不会自动分配到策略组。导入后请检查策略组分配及 Doona 的更新行为。"

msgid "Imported items are not assigned to groups automatically."
msgstr "导入的项目不会自动分配到策略组。"

msgid "This installed core does not support the requested import operation."
msgstr "当前安装的核心程序不支持此导入操作。"

msgid "The import request is incomplete or invalid."
msgstr "导入请求不完整或无效。"

msgid "The core could not prepare this import preview."
msgstr "核心程序无法准备此导入预览。"

msgid "Share links exceed the 16 KiB per request limit."
msgstr "分享链接超过单次 16 KiB 的限制。"

msgid "A share link is invalid or conflicts with an existing node. Review the input and try again."
msgstr "分享链接无效或与现有节点冲突，请检查内容后重试。"

msgid "The subscription name or URL is invalid."
msgstr "订阅名称或地址无效。"

msgid "The subscription is invalid or its name already exists."
msgstr "订阅无效或名称已存在。"

msgid "The dae file contains invalid sections or unsupported includes."
msgstr "dae 文件包含无效配置段或不支持的 include。"

msgid "Honk could not load the proposed configuration."
msgstr "Honk 无法加载准备写入的配置。"

msgid "The imported configuration failed core validation."
msgstr "导入配置未通过核心程序校验。"

msgid "Honk or Doona changed the configuration during this operation. Try again."
msgstr "操作期间 Honk 或 Doona 修改了配置，请重试。"

msgid "The preview expired. Create a new preview."
msgstr "预览已过期，请重新预览。"

msgid "The saved preview is damaged. Create a new preview."
msgstr "已保存的预览已损坏，请重新预览。"

msgid "The dae upload is missing or unavailable. Upload the file again."
msgstr "dae 上传文件缺失或不可用，请重新上传。"

msgid "The uploaded dae file is invalid."
msgstr "上传的 dae 文件无效。"

msgid "The uploaded dae file changed. Upload it again."
msgstr "上传的 dae 文件已更改，请重新上传。"

msgid "A private upload location could not be prepared."
msgstr "无法准备私有上传目录。"

msgid "Preview dae file"
msgstr "预览 dae 文件"

msgid "Subscriptions and nodes are appended by default. Import does not start Honk or change DNS settings."
msgstr "订阅和节点默认采用追加方式。导入不会启动 Honk，也不会更改 DNS 设置。"

msgid "Save pending edits in Doona before applying a configuration change."
msgstr "应用配置更改前，请先在 Doona 保存尚未提交的编辑。"

msgid "Log source"
msgstr "日志来源"

msgid "All levels"
msgstr "所有级别"

msgid "Minimum level"
msgstr "最低级别"

msgid "Warnings and errors"
msgstr "警告和错误"

msgid "Errors only"
msgstr "仅错误"

msgid "Pause"
msgstr "暂停"

msgid "Download redacted log"
msgstr "下载脱敏日志"

msgid "Shows the latest 200 lines, capped at 256 KiB, and refreshes every 5 seconds while live."
msgstr "显示最近 200 行，最多 256 KiB；实时模式下每 5 秒刷新。"

msgid "Log output is unavailable."
msgstr "日志内容暂不可用。"

msgid "Reset Honk data"
msgstr "重置 Honk 数据"

msgid "Reset clears Honk subscriptions, nodes, policies, DNS data, history, and cache, then restores default configuration. It keeps the administrator account and does not change OpenWrt services."
msgstr "重置会清除 Honk 订阅、节点、策略、DNS 数据、历史记录和缓存，并恢复默认配置。管理员账号会保留，也不会更改 OpenWrt 服务。"

msgid "Reset is unavailable until the pinned core reset action is installed."
msgstr "固定版本核心程序尚未安装重置操作，因此目前无法重置。"

msgid "Honk updates"
msgstr "Honk 更新"

msgid "Updates install the matching Honk core, LuCI, Doona assets, and Chinese translation as one package set."
msgstr "更新会一次安装相互匹配的 Honk 核心、LuCI、Doona 资源和简体中文翻译包。"

msgid "This target supports x86_64 on OpenWrt 25.12 using APK packages."
msgstr "此目标支持 OpenWrt 25.12 x86_64 和 APK 软件包。"

msgid "No trusted signed feed and compatibility manifest are configured, so no update is available."
msgstr "尚未配置可信签名软件源和兼容性清单，因此目前没有可用更新。"

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "检查更新"

msgid "A compatible update is available: %s"
msgstr "发现兼容更新：%s"

msgid "A previous maintenance operation needs recovery before write operations can continue."
msgstr "上次维护操作需要先恢复，才能继续执行写入操作。"

msgid "Applying the staged data…"
msgstr "正在应用暂存的数据……"

msgid "Backup created."
msgstr "备份已创建。"

msgid "Checking update source…"
msgstr "正在检查更新源……"

msgid "Core"
msgstr "核心"

msgid "Could not read Honk logs."
msgstr "无法读取 Honk 日志。"

msgid "Creating backup…"
msgstr "正在创建备份……"

msgid "Debug and above"
msgstr "调试及以上"

msgid "Executed checks: %s"
msgstr "已执行的检查：%s"

msgid "Honk data reset. The service is stopped."
msgstr "Honk 数据已重置，服务已停止。"

msgid "Honk logs are unavailable."
msgstr "Honk 日志暂不可用。"

msgid "Info and above"
msgstr "信息及以上"

