msgstr "维护进程意外停止。请先检查系统恢复状态，再重试。"

msgid "This permanently clears Honk subscriptions, nodes, policies, DNS data, history, and cache, then restores the default configuration. The administrator account is kept, and Honk will be stopped. Continue?"
msgstr "此操作会永久清除 Honk 订阅、节点、策略、DNS 数据、历史记录和缓存，并恢复默认配置，但保留管理员账号并停止 Honk。是否继续？"

